# PLAN-998 legacy A2R resource-scenario certification extension — the six
# H-07 scenario cells (binding ns=scenario R01..R06) certified in the
# resource-scenario domain: the EXPLICIT `legacy-a2r.resources-observe/1`
# profile instruments the real ownership paths of the production emission
# (per-owner create/transfer/release guards, allocation-count fault
# sentinels, structural list-mutation events, budget/cancel steps); the
# R06 trap leg additionally selects `legacy-a2r.checked-i32/1` (combined
# profiles — the typed trap unwinds through the real Drop guards).
# a2r-ONLY by design: this suite is the daily zero-spawn face (emit +
# byte-compare against the G04-reviewed scene goldens at oracle/scenario/);
# the real compile+run certification is the ace-certify --resource tool
# (never this suite), and the value/trap domains are untouched.

```test-case
case {
  schema: "autolang.case/2"
  id: "ace.m1.a2rscene.r01"
  tags: ["ace-m1", "a2r-resources-998"]
  links: ["PLAN-998"]
  source: { file: "legacy-a2r-resources-998/src/R01.at", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }
  entry: { mode: "program" }
  checks: [
    { id: "a2r-scene-emit", adapter: "a2r", action: "emit", options: { module_name: "m1_r01", resource_profile: "legacy-a2r.resources-observe/1" },
      expect: { completion: "success", artifacts: [
        { path: "m1_r01.rs", file: "oracle/scenario/m1_r01.rs", compare: "bytes" } ] } }
  ]
}
```

